# Every platform builds the Agent and Home pages, and Sentry keeps one copy of
# each page and its source map for a build (Packaging/sentry_page_maps.sh), so
# the files the pages are built from must read the same everywhere. A Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf=true) would give them CRLF line endings, which the
# pages keep in their text. resources/jusprin and docs/guide have the same rule.
AgentUI/** text=auto eol=lf
HomeUI/** text=auto eol=lf
WebShared/** text=auto eol=lf
Localization/** text=auto eol=lf
